'-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">To participate, you must:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Provide accurate, complete, and current information in your UpPromote portal.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Maintain a valid PayPal account for payouts (see Section 7).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Comply with all laws, regulations, and platform rules applicable to your marketing methods (including FTC disclosure requirements and any social platform advertising rules).</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-de