 complete all tax-related fields and documentation requested in your affiliate portal to comply with U.S. tax requirements, including any forms necessary for 1099 reporting (if applicable).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">HangSmart may withhold payments where required by law or where tax documentation is incomplete, inaccurate, outdated, or not provided.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">HangSmart does not provide tax, legal, or accounting advice. You should consult your professional advisor.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">4) Program Terms, Commission Rules &amp; Tracking</h2><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Commissions are earned only on qualifying purchases completed through properly tracked referral links or approved affiliate codes.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Tracking is managed via UpPromote and is subject to browser settings, cookie restrictions, ad blockers, device switching, or other technical limitations.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">HangSmart reserves the right to determine, in its sole discretion, whether a transaction is valid for commission.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>Non-commissionable orders may include (but are not limited to):</strong></p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Orders that are cancelled, refunded, charged back, or found to be fraudulent.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Self-referrals (you purchasing through your own link/code) unless explicitly permitted in writing.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Orders placed using unapproved discount methods, unauthorized coupon stacking, or deceptive code practices.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Orders referred through prohibited advertising methods listed in this Policy.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">5) Affiliate Coupon Codes &amp; Offer Integrity (Strict)</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">HangSmart allows Affiliates to use approved coupon codes provided through the UpPromote portal. Affiliates must represent discounts and offers truthfully and exactly as authorized.</p><h3 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:18px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">You may NOT:</h3><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Create, edit, or present a coupon code as offering a discount different from what the program provides.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Misstate or exaggerate the value of an offer (e.g., calling a 15% code “25% off,” “BOGO,” “free,” etc.).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Publish “custom codes” that imply a discount, free shipping, rebates, or special terms that are not approved by HangSmart.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Encourage customers to manipulate checkout behavior (e.g., “stack this with other codes,” “use this to bypass pricing,” etc.) unless explicitly authorized.</li></ul><h3 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:18px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Zero-tolerance enforcement:</h3><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">If an affiliate enters a program offering (for example) <strong>15% off</strong>, and promotes a code as anything other than <strong>15% off</strong>, or uses any method to mislead customers about the discount, <strong>the affiliate may be permanently removed from the Program</strong>.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">6) Deceptive Practices, Misrepresentation &amp; Abuse (Withholding + Termination)</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">HangSmart has a strict policy against deceptive practices and program abuse. We reserve the right to investigate any affiliate activity at any time.</p><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>Deceptive practices include, but are not limited to:</strong></p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Misrepresenting discount amounts, pricing, shipping terms, return terms, warranty terms, or product capabilities.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Using misleading countdown timers, fake scarcity, or false claims such as “official partner,” “exclusive deal,” “only today,” “guaranteed delivery,” etc. when not authorized.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Impersonating HangSmart, claiming affiliation beyond being an affiliate, or using HangSmart branding in a way that confuses customers.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Using “coupon sites” or posting codes in discount forums if your program prohibits it (or if it causes brand harm).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Cookie stuffing, forced clicks, link injection, pop-ups that overwrite tracking, or any tactic intended to illegitimately claim commission.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Generating fake leads, fake orders, or incentivized purchases intended to trigger commissions.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Purchasing through your own links/codes to earn commission (self-dealing), unless explicitly authorized.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Any attempt to exploit errors in tracking, pricing, or platform systems.</li></ul><h3 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:18px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Our remedies (at our discretion):</h3><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">If we suspect or determine deceptive practices or abuse, HangSmart may, in its sole discretion:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\"><strong>Withhold</strong> some or all affiliate payouts (including pending payouts) during investigation;</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\"><strong>Reverse</strong> commissions associated with abusive activity;</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\"><strong>Disable</strong> codes/links and terminate your affiliate account immediately;</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\"><strong>Permanently ban</strong> the affiliate from all HangSmart programs;</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Pursue further remedies where permitted by law, including chargebacks, platform reporting, and legal action.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">7) Payouts (PayPal Only) &amp; Automation</h2><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">All payouts are processed <strong>only through PayPal</strong> via the UpPromote system.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Payouts are <strong>fully automated</strong> based on tracked and approved commissions.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">You are responsible for ensuring your PayPal email and payout details are correct and up to date in your affiliate portal.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">HangSmart is not responsible for lost payouts due to incorrect PayPal information entered by the Affiliate.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">HangSmart may apply a holding period for returns, fraud checks, and verification (as set within UpPromote and/or your specific program).</p><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">8) FTC Disclosures &amp; Advertising Compliance</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Affiliates must clearly disclose the affiliate relationship anywhere an affiliate link or code is posted.</p><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Examples of acceptable disclosure:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">“I may earn a commission if you purchase through my link.”</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">“Affiliate link” or “Sponsored / Partner” (where required by platform rules)</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Affiliates must comply with:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">FTC endorsement guidelines,</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Local advertising laws,</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Platform-specific rules (Meta, TikTok, YouTube, Google, etc.).</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">9) Brand Usage Guidelines (HangSmart® IP)</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Affiliates may only use HangSmart trademarks, logos, images, videos, or copy provided by HangSmart (or explicitly approved in writing).</p><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">You may NOT:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Use HangSmart logos or trademarks in your social handle, domain name, paid ad account name, or as part of another brand name.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Create websites or social pages that imitate HangSmart or could confuse customers into thinking you are HangSmart.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Use altered product images that materially misrepresent HangSmart products.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Claim you are an employee, official representative, reseller, or authorized dealer unless expressly authorized in writing.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">10) Prohibited Marketing Methods</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Unless expressly approved in writing, affiliates may not:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position:inside;padding-left:2rem;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Bid on HangSmart branded terms in paid search ads (e.g., “HangSmart,” “HangSmart TV,” misspellings, or close variations).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Run ads that direct-link to HangSmart using your affiliate link where prohibited by platform rules.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Use spam tactics (mass unsolicited emails, automated DMs, comment spam).</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;\">Use toolbars, plugins, or software that injects or replaces tracking links.</li><li style=\"list-style:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Mislead customers with fake reviews, fabricated testimonials, or inaccurate product claims.</li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">11) Returns, Cancellations &amp; Chargebacks</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">If an order is refunded, cancelled, charged back, or deemed fraudulent, associated commissions may be reversed. HangSmart may withhold payouts until orders pass the applicable return/refund window or fraud checks.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">12) Termination &amp; Modification</h2><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">HangSmart may suspend or terminate any affiliate account at any time, with or without notice, if we determine you violated this Policy or acted in a way that harms our brand or customers.</p><p style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">HangSmart may modify this Policy at any time by updating this page. Continued participation after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised Policy.</p><h2 style=\"font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:rgb(18,18,18);line-height:1.3;font-size:24px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">13) Contact</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgba(18,18,18,0.75);font-family:'system_ui', '-apple-system', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Noto Sans', 'Liberation Sans', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';font-size:18.4px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.69px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">If you have questions about this Policy or your affiliate status, contact:<br><strong><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" style=\"color:rgba(18,18,18,0.85);text-decoration-thickness:0.1rem;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Legal@hangsmart.com</a></strong></p>",
